angelog#-显示","content":"📱 显示"},"168":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-bot-编辑器","content":"🤖 Bot 编辑器"},"169":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"🐛 修复"},"170":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#v102-2026-05-28","content":"v1.0.2 (2026-05-28)"},"171":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"⚡ 性能优化"},"172":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-问题修复","content":"🐛 问题修复"},"173":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-重构","content":"🔧 重构"},"174":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-国际化","content":"🌐 国际化"},"175":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端其他改进","content":"📱 移动端其他改进"},"176":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-服务端","content":"🖥 服务端"},"177":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#v101-2026-05-22","content":"v1.0.1 (2026-05-22)"},"178":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-新主题系统","content":"🎨 新主题系统"},"179":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-全新文档站","content":"📖 全新文档站"},"180":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端改进","content":"📱 移动端改进"},"181":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-安全与可靠性","content":"🔒 安全与可靠性"},"182":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化-1","content":"⚡ 性能优化"},"183":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-其他","content":"🛠 其他"},"184":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/changelog#v100-2026-05-16","content":"v1.0.0 (2026-05-16)"},"185":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-机器人回复","content":"**首次回复与追问共用同一套规则。** 机器人的首次回复与线程中后续的每次追问，现在使用同一套通用对话规则，不再分别指导。规则保留各个角色的人设语气，同时要求模型只回应真正说出的内容、不替对方读心、避免空泛套话与强行升华，并将检索到的旧记忆视为可能相关的片段 —— 只有当它明确有助于当前话题时才提及。"},"186":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-机器人回复","content":"**有分寸地使用记忆。** 旧记忆的发生时间会被保留，跨记录的代词引用在没有证据时不合并。当前消息的权重大于旧上下文。"},"187":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端","content":"**修复：首页输入框键盘动画掉帧。** Memo 输入框现在在 UI 线程跟随原生键盘动画，减少软键盘弹出和收起时的卡顿。"},"188":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端","content":"**修复：筛选抽屉从设置界面意外弹出。** 筛选抽屉现在只在搜索页获得焦点时挂载，离开搜索页会自动关闭。"},"189":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-1","content":"**修复：新建 Memo 图片即时显示。** 创建带图片的 Memo 时，图片会直接从本地相册 URI 渲染，不再等待服务端返回（此前因网络 + CORS 延迟会出现空白/破损缩略图）。网格磁贴先显示本地图片，同时在后台静默预加载远程缩略图，远程加载完成的瞬间无缝切换到远程 URL — 图片始终可见，切换无感知。"},"190":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-2","content":"**修复：本地推送通知去重。** 同一事件不再重复堆叠本地通知。"},"191":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-2","content":"**修复：Android 安装包权限。** 授予 `REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES` 权限，应用内更新安装 APK 时无需手动授权。"},"192":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-2","content":"**修复：更新徽章与进度条对齐。** 修正应用内更新徽章点击区域与进度条布局。"},"193":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**Bot 配置管理。** Bot 编辑功能已从移动端完全迁移至 Dashboard（`/bots`）。名称、描述、标签、自动回复、头像、模型 — 所有字段集中管理。"},"194":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**模型覆盖字段。** Bot 编辑器新增 `model` 字段，支持按 Bot 覆盖默认模型（留空则使用系统默认）。"},"195":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**活动刷新优化。** 点击刷新不再闪现骨架屏占位块，旧数据保持可见直到新数据加载完成。"},"196":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-dashboard","content":"**主题色彩修复。** Clean Slate 主题下 accent 前景色从近黑色改为白色，在绿色背景上清晰可读。"},"197":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-移动端-3","content":"**Bot 列表改为只读。** 设置中移除 Bot 编辑功能，保留名称、头像、标签展示，自动回复状态以胶囊徽章呈现（Auto 实心 / Manual 描边）。"},"198":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**Memo 图片现在会随文本一起发送给 AI。** 每日日记归档现在会将 Memo 图片与文本一同发送。每条 Memo 独立为一条消息，配图内联在对应消息中，AI 能正确关联图片与文本上下文。限制：每条 Memo 最多 2 张图片，每次归档最多 6 张。"},"199":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**超限图片以文字描述提供。** 超出限制的图片会通过 AI 生成文字描述，作为文本上下文附加到对应 Memo，确保没有图片信息被完全丢弃。"},"200":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-ai-日记归档","content":"**持久化图片描述。** 图片上传时即生成 AI 描述并存入 `resources.ai_description` 列。日记归档复用这些已存储的描述，避免重复调用视觉模型。"},"201":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-显示","content":"**高清图片开关。** 设置 → 通用。开启后 Memo 卡片网格和全屏预览直接展示原图，无需缩略图→查看原图的步骤。关闭时保留原有的模糊到清晰渐进加载流程。设置持久化到设备存储。"},"202":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-bot-编辑器","content":"FPS 性能监控"},"203":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-bot-编辑器","content":"描述编辑器"},"204":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"首页和 Bot 编辑器的键盘处理优化"},"205":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"SafeKeyboardProvider 边界情况修复"},"206":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-修复","content":"键盘切换和折叠状态下的掉帧修复"},"207":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"**修复键盘卡顿** — BotEditorSheet 改用 `KeyboardAwareScrollView`（UI 线程原生动画），消除软键盘弹出/收起时的掉帧卡顿"},"208":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"升级 `react-native-keyboard-controller` 1.18.5 → 1.21.8 — 带来 layout-free 键盘动画、内存泄漏修复、Fabric 兼容性提升"},"209":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-性能优化","content":"FullScreenEditor 从 React Native 内置 `KeyboardAvoidingView` 迁移至 keyboard-controller 原生版本"},"210":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/changelog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/changelog#-问题修复","content":"修复归档弹窗关闭后切换日期会意外重新弹出的问题（BottomSheetModal props 变化导致 re-present）"},"211":{"id":"/zh/docs/changelog-59","page_id":"/z