pi","content":"实时端点：`http://localhost:8080/openapi.json`"},"468":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#openapi","content":"仓库中的规范源文件：`server-go/internal/httpapi/openapi.json`"},"469":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#openapi","content":"`GET /openapi.json` 是公共端点 —— 无需认证，返回 JSON。端口跟随 `PORT`，若服务端\n运行在其他端口，则在该端口提供该文档。"},"470":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#openapi","content":"该文档在构建时嵌入服务端二进制（`//go:embed`）。若运行中的镜像是在此入口添加之前构建\n的，`/openapi.json` 会返回 `404`；只有用新镜像重新部署后，该端点才会出现。"},"471":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-swagger-editor","content":"打开 editor.swagger.io。"},"472":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-swagger-editor","content":"选择 **File → Import URL**（或将保存的副本通过 **File → Import File** 粘贴）。"},"473":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-swagger-editor","content":"填入 `http://localhost:8080/openapi.json`。"},"474":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-swagger-editor","content":"导入成功后会列出所有操作，且不报校验错误。Swagger Editor 用于校验和浏览文档；其\n**Authorize** 和 try-it-out 请求能否到达你的服务端，取决于编辑器的网络可达性与你设置的\n服务端地址，因此这些请求只能视为尽力而为。需要发送真实请求时，请在能够访问服务端的\n环境中使用 Swagger UI 或 Postman。"},"475":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-postman","content":"在 Postman 中点击 **Import**。"},"476":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-postman","content":"选择 **Link** 标签，填入 `http://localhost:8080/openapi.json`；或选择 **File**\n标签并选取保存的 JSON 副本。"},"477":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#导入-postman","content":"导入为新 collection，然后把 collection 指向你的服务端再发送请求。"},"478":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#服务端地址与本地访问","content":"文档声明的服务端地址是相对值（`/`）。远端工具导入后，该相对值会解析为工具自身站点，\n请求因此会打到工具站而不是 Mosaic。请把服务端地址显式设置为你的实例 —— 例如在\nSwagger UI 或 Swagger Editor 中填 `http://localhost:8080`，或在 Postman 中设置\n`baseUrl` collection 变量。"},"479":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#服务端地址与本地访问","content":"本地访问存在常见限制："},"480":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#服务端地址与本地访问","content":"明文 HTTP 的 `http://localhost:8080` 只能从本机访问。从其他设备访问时，请用主机的\n局域网地址打开页面；需要加入 `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` 的是**调用页面的来源**（例如\n`https://editor.swagger.io` 或你自己的 UI 来源），而不是服务端的局域网地址 —— 服务端\n地址不是 origin，不应写入。"},"481":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#服务端地址与本地访问","content":"浏览器将 `http://localhost` 和 `http://127.0.0.1` 视为潜在可信来源，因此 HTTPS 页面\n通常仍可请求 `http://localhost`。拦截只针对其他明文 HTTP 目标（例如局域网 IP）：\nHTTPS 页面无法请求这些地址。此时请下载 JSON 并以文件方式导入，或为服务端启用 HTTPS。"},"482":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#服务端地址与本地访问","content":"携带 `Authorization` 头会触发浏览器 CORS 预检。调用方来源必须被服务端 CORS 策略\n允许；`ALLOWED_ORIGINS` 为空时才为宽松模式（仅限开发）。"},"483":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#示例请求","content":"以下均为虚构示例，除非你替换为自己的值："},"484":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#示例请求","content":"`GET /api/memos` 返回分页信封（`items`、`total`、`page`、`pageSize`、`totalPages`）；\n`GET /api/memos/search` 使用另一种结构。每个响应的准确结构以该文档为准。"},"485":{"id":"/zh/docs/openapi-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/openapi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/openapi#说明","content":"该文档